Yup, it's the "sortloot" option; you can set it to "full", "loot", or
"none".  "Loot" will sort the listings when you loot/apply containers or
pick things up, and "full" also sorts inventory and drop listings.

I'd rank this patch a very small notch below "indispensable"; I like it set
to "loot".

